    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Test whether a transient measured voltage perturbation produces a persistent, heritable-through-regeneration morphology without DNA change, and whether restoring the voltage state reverses it across multiple animal systems.";
