    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Alternative epigenetic or tissue-state mechanisms remain.", "Evidence is concentrated in planaria rather than showing a conserved animal mechanism.", "False pattern memory is a contested interpretation.";
